generic class.description:
TS 1.0 (generics)
class Name<T> { ... }
Parameterizes a class's members over a type variable, resolved at instantiation (`new Name<string>(...)`).

const type parameter.description:
TS 5.0
function name<const T>(arg: T)
The `const` modifier on a type parameter infers the narrowest (literal) possible type from the argument, without the caller needing an explicit `as const`.
